        "payload": "tree 246109929cd7c721a97980add3b3d6396fd5d260\nparent fac9c100c72b136acec7f94b0d466c4a8e8c2e6c\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792086638 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792095526 +0200\n\nvalidation: check sigops limit before staging\n\nPreChecks stages a transaction in the mempool changeset before it\nchecks MAX_STANDARD_TX_SIGOPS_COST. The bound on -bytespersigop keeps\nsigop-adjusted sizes in int32_t only for transactions within that\nlimit. A transaction that is otherwise standard can be far above it:\ntwo P2WSH inputs with 50020 sigops each are 1365 vbytes. At\n-bytespersigop=21474, 100040 * 21474 = 2148258960 exceeds INT32_MAX,\nand staging it fails Assume(feerate.size > 0) in\nTxGraphImpl::AddTransaction, which aborts a debug build.\n\nCheck the limit right after counting the sigops, before staging.\n",
